ish something and  that's something i've had to learn over  time  so yeah i don't enjoy reviewing games  anymore but that doesn't mean that i  don't still you know share opinions or  impressions obviously  and the last ones that i have a bunch of  that again i've answered before but are  really easy to answer  along the lines of would you like to get  into the game's design part of business  as a part of a team creating games or  are you happy staying as an outsider  someone also basically said you always  say you like writing in video games do  you do other kinds of writing i've  definitely said this in videos before i  want to write a video game one day i've  said that on instagram i've said it on  twitter i want to write a video again  one day  yeah i do a lot of fiction writing in my  spare time  people have asked you know what am i  writing i have no interest in sharing  any of it like maybe i will eventually  but i really just do it for me so i  don't i don't  feel compelled to have other people read  any of it i feel like that's a strange  approach to writing books but i just  don't i like  i like doing them and completing them  and experiencing that but i don't care  about  anything being published so i don't know  if that makes me weird but yes i  absolutely have always loved that part  of writing as well i've been writing  books since  i could literally write um so i feel  like it was always going to be one of  the other no matter what i was going to  end up in video games because that's  been  like one of the things i've been most  passionate about my whole life and the  other thing is writing so it was either  gonna be write a video game write about  video games  and i think i will probably do both and  that is it from me today  everyone i'm alana i will see you guys  next time
 

